35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people used it eleven times, others four.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The last awkward talk was across desks, in front of everyone.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire, but it was for small groups.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The meeting space quote is 141,000 yen, the kitchen is 96,000.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is single plasterboard; I can hear every word inside.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, so we are paying for space we could use ourselves?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, that is a lot of money for a table and screen.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, yes, and the lunch trip takes twenty-five minutes.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, but the kitchen is cheaper, though it needs an electrician.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, the crumbs are under three keyboards now.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The bins go out daily because people eat at their desks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Since the sofa went in, unplanned talk only happens by the printer.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,Most of us make the lunch trip three or four days a week.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Facilities had eleven callouts for equipment rooms, none for the store.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"When the old fridge was cleared, half the food was nobody's.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, that explains the mess. We need a system.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, if we eat there, we might actually talk.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, the kitchen seems practical if we maintain it.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the meeting space is expensive and we already have outside hire.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, a quiet room won't help if the wall is thin.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
